5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Let’s pick a destination that works for everyone. I’m worried about the cost hitting some members harder than others.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry the year-groups barely talk outside practice. Where we stay decides who spends evenings together.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I’m concerned about the workload. Last year’s organizers lost a month to arrangements and spent the camp on duty.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I want to know what the nights and days would actually be like. Half of us slept badly last time, and it ruined the final day","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I need to see exactly where the money went last year before we commit to anything.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, that makes sense. @Ryuji, do you think we can find a place that doesn’t require so much manual labor from us?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Ryuji, that is a heavy burden. @Mio, perhaps a place with staff could help both of you?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, yes. A place with staff would solve the cooking and setup burden. @Shizue, I agree.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, if we have staff, do they handle the lights and noise too? I need quiet nights to actually train well.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, staff might help, but I need to verify the actual costs first. @Mio, let’s look at the transport receipts and the public bed rates.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
