35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, the whole-building terms are strict. If someone drops out late, the rest of us pay for their bed.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, that is worrying. @Ryuji, I found that mixing only happens when we sleep together. @Rin, attendance was poor last time.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Ryuji"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shizue, that confirms my fear. @Rin, the canteen closes, so we’d cook for two hours daily. @Misaki, the public booking lottery is a nightmare to manage.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Rin"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, that sounds exhausting. @Misaki, the inland clubs slept eight to a room with lights out at eleven.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, eight to a room is unacceptable. @Mio, the transport costs are the biggest line item, so staying local saves us significantly.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, that explains the gap. @Rin, eight to a room is terrible. @Shizue, if mixing needs shared sleeping, we must find a place that allows it.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Rin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, yes. @Rin, those conditions explain the poor sleep. @Ryuji, the lottery risk is high. We need a place that guarantees our space.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Rin"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shizue, exactly. The application is rigid. @Mio, the canteen closure means we cook daily. @Rin, the public beds are cheap but crowded.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Mio"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, eight to a room is awful. @Misaki, the public beds are cheap, but I need to know if they are actually quiet enough for me to sleep.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, the rate sheet shows 1,100 yen per bed, but it doesn’t guarantee quiet. @Mio, the transport receipts confirm staying local saves us the most money.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, that’s good news for the budget. @Shizue, if we stay local, how do we ensure the year-groups actually mix?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, the seniors say mixing only happens in shared evenings. @Rin, the attendance sheets show a fifth never came, mostly due to travel.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shizue, that is a problem. @Mio, if we stay local, the hall timetable is packed. We’d train at odd hours.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, odd hours are bad for sleep. @Misaki, if we stay local, can we actually afford the beds for those who can’t commute?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, a third of the club can’t make it by nine without a bed. @Mio, that means we still pay for accommodation even if we stay local.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, that’s a huge hidden cost. @Shizue, if we stay local, we still pay for beds for a third of us.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, yes. @Rin, the attendance data shows travel is a major barrier. We need a place that brings everyone together comfortably.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Rin, the hall is booked by three other clubs. We’d train at dawn and dusk, which ruins sleep.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, dawn training is impossible for me. @Misaki, if we stay local, we still pay for beds. @Shizue, how do we fix the year-group divide then?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Misaki"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, staying local is financially impossible. @Shizue, we need a place that guarantees sleep and allows mixing, without the lottery risk.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
