60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, the options are out. A is local, B is the public centre, C is the coastal lodge. Which one fits our needs?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, C seems best. It offers shared evenings for mixing, unlike A. @Ryuji, does C avoid the lottery risk of B?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
