63,3,1,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, that deposit risk worries me. @Misaki, does C guarantee quiet nights so I can actually sleep?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, C includes meals and staff, so no cooking duty. @Mio, the fixed headcount is risky, but it avoids the transport costs that broke us last year.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, the deposit risk is real. @Misaki, if we pick C, we must set a strict deadline for dropouts to protect the budget.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, a strict deadline is wise. @Rin, the lodge offers private rooms, so you should sleep well. @Ryuji, the staff handle everything, saving us from duty.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Rin"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
