68,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shizue, private rooms sound perfect for my sleep. @Mio, I’m in for C, as long as we lock the dates early to avoid that deposit trap.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
